{"name":"Limeño Limón","hex":"#f8b109","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Lima","blocks":[{"text":"Lima is the capital and largest city of Peru, as well as a primate city. It is located in the valleys of the Chillón, Rímac and Lurín Rivers, in the desert zone of the central coastal part of the country, overlooking the Pacific Ocean. The city is considered the political, cultural, financial and commercial center of Peru. Jurisdictionally, the metropolis extends mainly within the province of Lima and in a smaller portion, to the west, within the Constitutional Province of Callao, where the seaport and the Jorge Chávez Airport are located. Both provinces have had regional autonomy since 2002."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/69/Bas%C3%ADlica_Catedral_Metropolitana_de_Lima_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Bas%C3%ADlica_Catedral_Metropolitana_de_Lima_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lima","wikidata":"Q2868"},{"title":"Limón","blocks":[{"text":"Limón, also known as Puerto Limón, is the capital city of both the province and canton of the same name. One of Costa Rica's seven \"middle cities\", Limón has a population of 71,514, which made it, as of 2022, the most-populous city in the country outside of the Greater Metropolitan Area and the second most-populous district in the nation."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/15/Lim%C3%B3n_-_Panoramic_view_from_Downtown_Lim%C3%B3n.jpg/330px-Lim%C3%B3n_-_Panoramic_view_from_Downtown_Lim%C3%B3n.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lim%C3%B3n","wikidata":"Q30620"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/48/Ciudad_De_Lima.jpg/500px-Ciudad_De_Lima.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/48/Ciudad_De_Lima.jpg/500px-Ciudad_De_Lima.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACiudad_De_Lima.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e9/Urban_View_of_Lima%2C_Peru_09_%28Night_City%29.jpg/500px-Urban_View_of_Lima%2C_Peru_09_%28Night_City%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e9/Urban_View_of_Lima%2C_Peru_09_%28Night_City%29.jpg/500px-Urban_View_of_Lima%2C_Peru_09_%28Night_City%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AUrban_View_of_Lima%2C_Peru_09_(Night_City).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Parque_de_La_Reserva%2C_Lima_-_Peru_-_panoramio_%287%29.jpg/500px-Parque_de_La_Reserva%2C_Lima_-_Peru_-_panoramio_%287%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Parque_de_La_Reserva%2C_Lima_-_Peru_-_panoramio_%287%29.jpg/1280px-Parque_de_La_Reserva%2C_Lima_-_Peru_-_panoramio_%287%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Parque_de_La_Reserva%2C_Lima_-_Peru_-_panoramio_%287%29.jpg/500px-Parque_de_La_Reserva%2C_Lima_-_Peru_-_panoramio_%287%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AParque_de_La_Reserva%2C_Lima_-_Peru_-_panoramio_(7).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/San_Francisco_Lima.jpg/330px-San_Francisco_Lima.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/San_Francisco_Lima.jp